## Contract first

`src/main/openapi/openapi.yaml` is the source of truth. Request and response models are generated at
build time into `{{api.modelPackage}}` (never versioned). Controllers were generated once
as skeletons that answer `501 Not Implemented` until each operation is implemented.

- `axiz contract sync` adds skeletons for new operations, reports removed ones and checks breaking
  changes against the previous version (openapi-diff).
- Lint the contract with the axiz Spectral ruleset before publishing it.
- Declare access per operation or inherit root `security`: OAuth2/OpenID Connect scopes produce
  a scope guard, an empty bearer/OAuth2 scope list requires authentication, and explicit
  `security: []` declares public access. Missing or unsupported policies fail generation.
- Review `axiz.security.public-paths` when merging a new public operation during contract sync.
  Public paths must not overlap authenticated-only routes; use distinct paths or scoped guards.

